{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "da4a4d72-45e9-846f-a107-1b70dc8ceeab",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:40:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. My trash bin, it is broken. The truck, it broke it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the truck damaged your bin. I'm sorry about that. Can you tell me where you live?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four three five Eustis Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "435 Eustis Avenue. Got it. And what happened to the bin, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid is gone. And one side, it is cracked. This was today, in the morning. I see the truck, then I go outside, and it is like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the lid came off and the side is cracked, and it happened this morning during pickup. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Yes, this is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll write that up for the crew supervisor so they can look at a replacement. Is the bin still usable at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Little bit. Without the lid, no. The rain, it goes inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I get a phone number in case someone needs to call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one nine six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0196. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, cell. And when somebody comes, I can pay for the new one. I like to pay with cash. I have a lot of cash with me, always. Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say yet whether there'll be a charge. If the truck caused the damage, they may just replace it. Whoever follows up will explain that to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Anything else I can note down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. When is the next pickup? For trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For 435 Eustis, it's your regular day, so one week from today, next Monday. Do you want me to repeat that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next Monday. Same day as today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, next Monday. Until the bin is replaced, you could set your trash out in a sturdy container, just so it's easy to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A container. I understand. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:40:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Gomes. Someone will be in touch. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:40:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye bye."
    }
  ],
